AB  - Electromagnetic navigation bronchoscopy (ENB) has come a long way from the early 
      roots of electromagnetic theory. Current ENB devices have the potential to change 
      the way lung cancer is detected and treated. This paper provides an overview of 
      the history, current state, and future of ENB.
