AB  - Many hands can build a house; it takes trust to make that house a home. Trust has 
      two main components: credibility (worthiness based on preparation and past 
      performance) and empathy (the ability to understand and share another person's 
      values). CHEST has maintained its credibility and empathy as the global leader in 
      clinical pulmonary, critical care, and sleep medical education. It follows that 
      the leader in chest clinical education would also be the home of the 
      clinician-educator. You are that educator.
