TI  - A 22-Year-Old Nonsmoker With Diffuse Cystic Lung Disease.
PG  - e18-e21
LID - S0012-3692(15)50054-8 [pii]
LID - 10.1378/chest.14-2301 [doi]
AB  - A 22-year-old previously healthy woman was evaluated in pulmonary clinic for 
      shortness of breath and cough that had been slowly progressive over 3 months. She 
      otherwise reported being fully functional and attended her college graduation a 
      week prior to evaluation. She had no history of smoking, illicit drug use, 
      connective tissue disease, or noxious exposures.
