AB  - A 21-year-old woman with cystic fibrosis (CF) was seen in the pulmonary clinic 
      complaining of abdominal pain. Her past medical history included bilateral lung 
      transplantation for CF pulmonary disease 26 months previously, as well as 
      gastroesophageal reflux disease and pancreatic insufficiency. Her baseline weight 
      was 49.1 kg (BMI, 19.4 kg/m2).
